      "richText": "<article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Antigravity OAuth Plugin for Opencode</h1><a id=\"user-content-antigravity-oauth-plugin-for-opencode\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Antigravity OAuth Plugin for Opencode\" href=\"#antigravity-oauth-plugin-for-opencode\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/opencode-antigravity-auth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/02bbc80b2f1f0d4eb639134c616929e2d15298107193832c59cf25512c4b63e6/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6e706d2f762f6f70656e636f64652d616e7469677261766974792d617574682e737667\" alt=\"npm version\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/v/opencode-antigravity-auth.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Enable Opencode to authenticate against <strong>Antigravity</strong> (Google's IDE) via OAuth so you can use Antigravity rate limits and access models like <code>gemini-3-pro-high</code> and <code>claude-opus-4-5-thinking</code> with your Google credentials.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">What you get</h2><a id=\"user-content-what-you-get\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What you get\" href=\"#what-you-get\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Google OAuth sign-in</strong> with automatic token refresh</li>\n<li><strong>Antigravity API compatibility</strong> for OpenAI-style requests</li>\n<li><strong>Debug logging</strong> for requests and responses</li>\n<li><strong>Drop-in setup</strong>—Opencode auto-installs the plugin from config</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Quick start</h2><a id=\"user-content-quick-start\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Quick start\" href=\"#quick-start\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Add the plugin to config</strong> (<code>~/.config/opencode/opencode.json</code> or project <code>.opencode.json</code>):</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;plugin&quot;: [&quot;opencode-antigravity-auth@1.0.6&quot;]\n}\"><pre>{\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"plugin\"</span>: [<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>opencode-antigravity-auth@1.0.6<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>]\n}</pre></div>\n<ol start=\"2\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Authenticate</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Run <code>opencode auth login</code>.</li>\n<li>Choose Google → <strong>OAuth with Google (Antigravity)</strong>.</li>\n<li>Sign in via the browser and return to Opencode. If the browser doesn’t open, use the printed link.</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"3\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Declare the models you want</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add Antigravity models under the <code>provider.google.models</code> section of your config:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;plugin&quot;: [&quot;opencode-antigravity-auth&quot;],\n  &quot;provider&quot;: {\n    &quot;google&quot;: {\n      &quot;models&quot;: {\n        &quot;gemini-3-pro-high&quot;: {\n          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Gemini 3 Pro High (Antigravity)&quot;,\n          &quot;limit&quot;: {\n            &quot;context&quot;: 1048576,\n            &quot;output&quot;: 65535\n          }\n        },\n        &quot;gemini-3-pro-low&quot;: {\n          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Gemini 3 Pro Low (Antigravity)&quot;,\n          &quot;limit&quot;: {\n            &quot;context&quot;: 1048576,\n            &quot;output&quot;: 65535\n          }\n        },\n        &quot;claude-sonnet-4-5&quot;: {\n          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Claude Sonnet 4.5 (Antigravity)&quot;,\n          &quot;limit&quot;: {\n            &quot;context&quot;: 200000,\n            &quot;output&quot;: 64000\n          }\n        },\n        &quot;claude-sonnet-4-5-thinking&quot;: {\n          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Claude Sonnet 4.5 Thinking (Antigravity)&quot;,\n          &quot;limit&quot;: {\n            &quot;context&quot;: 200000,\n            &quot;output&quot;: 64000\n          }\n        },\n        &quot;claude-opus-4-5-thinking&quot;: {\n          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Claude Opus 4.5 Thinking (Antigravity)&quot;,\n          &quot;limit&quot;: {\n            &quot;context&quot;: 200000,\n            &quot;output&quot;: 64000\n          }\n        },\n        &quot;gpt-oss-120b-medium&quot;: {\n          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;GPT-OSS 120B Medium (Antigravity)&quot;,\n          &quot;limit&quot;: {\n            &quot;context&quot;: 131072,\n            &quot;output&quot;: 32768\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\"><pre>{\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"plugin\"</span>: [<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>opencode-antigravity-auth<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>],\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"provider\"</span>: {\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"google\"</span>: {\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"models\"</span>: {\n        <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"gemini-3-pro-high\"</span>: {\n          <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Gemini 3 Pro High (Antigravity)<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n          <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"limit\"</span>: {\n            <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"context\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">1048576</span>,\n            <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"output\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">65535</span>\n          }\n        },\n        <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"gemini-3-pro-low\"</span>: {\n          <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Gemini 3 Pro Low (Antigravity)<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n          <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"limit\"</span>: {\n            <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"context\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">1048576</span>,\n            <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"output\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">65535</span>\n          }\n        },\n        <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"claude-sonnet-4-5\"</span>: {\n          <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Claude Sonnet 4.5 (Antigravity)<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n          <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"limit\"</span>: {\n            <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"context\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">200000</span>,\n            <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"output\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">64000</span>\n          }\n        },\n        <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"claude-sonnet-4-5-thinking\"</span>: {\n          <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Claude Sonnet 4.5 Thinking (Antigravity)<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n          <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"limit\"</span>: {\n            <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"context\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">200000</span>,\n            <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"output\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">64000</span>\n          }\n        },\n        <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"claude-opus-4-5-thinking\"</span>: {\n          <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Claude Opus 4.5 Thinking (Antigravity)<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n          <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"limit\"</span>: {\n            <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"context\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">200000</span>,\n            <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"output\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">64000</span>\n          }\n        },\n        <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"gpt-oss-120b-medium\"</span>: {\n          <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>GPT-OSS 120B Medium (Antigravity)<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n          <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"limit\"</span>: {\n            <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"context\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">131072</span>,\n            <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"output\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">32768</span>\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}</pre></div>\n<ol start=\"4\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Use a model</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"opencode run &quot;Hello world&quot; --model=google/gemini-3-pro-high\"><pre>opencode run <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Hello world<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> --model=google/gemini-3-pro-high</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Debugging</h2><a id=\"user-content-debugging\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Debugging\" href=\"#debugging\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Enable verbose logging:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"export OPENCODE_ANTIGRAVITY_DEBUG=1\"><pre><span class=\"pl-k\">export</span> OPENCODE_ANTIGRAVITY_DEBUG=1</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Logs are written to the current directory (e.g., <code>antigravity-debug-&lt;timestamp&gt;.log</code>).</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Development</h2><a id=\"user-content-development\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Development\" href=\"#development\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npm install\"><pre>npm install</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Safety, usage, and risk notices</h2><a id=\"user-content-safety-usage-and-risk-notices\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Safety, usage, and risk notices\" href=\"#safety-usage-and-risk-notices\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3